---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyLegion AND whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenCancelNotLocked AND whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard --> q_revert_locked: cancelLocked == true
    q_revert_locked --> [*]: revert LegionSale__CancelLocked()
    q_guard --> q_verify: guards pass
    q_verify --> q_revert_published: sale results already published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert LegionSale__SaleResultsAlreadyPublished()
    q_verify --> q_lock: can publish
    q_lock --> q_emit: cancelLocked = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit PublishSaleResultsInitialized()

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: cancelLocked transitions from false to true exactly once
        INV-002: after locking, project cannot cancel the sale
        INV-003: this is step 1 of a 2-step publish process (lock cancel then publish results)
    end note
